        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The ground is corded white silk, the design consists of Ganemede on the eagle, Hercules and the centaur. Hercules on Narcissus? and a rampant lion, at a fountain, tulips, iris and other flowers out of all proportion to the figures.  The pattern is woven with green, yellow, pink and blue silk, blue chenille and brown cord."@en ;
